    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "DV16t",
      "x": 5290,
      "y": 1000,
      "name": "note1",
      "width": 380,
      "height": 300,
      "content": "SIDEBAR — MONITORING NAV ITEM\n\nPurpose: Links to the external Grafana observability stack. This is NOT an internal Next.js page.\n\nWhat it opens:\n• Grafana dashboards (Prometheus metrics)\n• Production Overview — spindle counts, mismatch rate, inference latency histograms, camera status grid\n• System Health — ESP32 CPU/RAM, RabbitMQ queue depths, DB write latency, FIFO queue depth\n• Alert History — mismatch timeline by shift, severity-colored events\n\nImplementation:\n• Use a plain <a> tag with href=\"http://grafana.internal:3000\" target=\"_blank\"\n• Add external-link icon (Lucide) to indicate it leaves the app\n• Do NOT use Next.js <Link> — this is an external URL\n• Consider a small \"opens in new tab\" tooltip on hover"
    },
